direction_609 = location "Crimson Wing" about "Crimson Wing\nCrimson Wings are ferovious Harpy monsters. With their savagery and scant intelligence, they indiscriminately level attacks at all organisms which enter its habitat. " found "Eslant" at 396 208 in zone 11

